## Runtime dependencies — used, not redistributed

`scripts/setup-venvs.sh` and the Debian runtime package install these with
pip at setup time; this repository ships none of their code.

  * tt-bio — MIT. github.com/moritztng/tt-bio
    Pinned to a release tag, never `main`. The pin lives in one variable at
    the top of scripts/setup-venvs.sh.

  * Protenix v1 model weights (ByteDance's Protenix v0.5.0 checkpoint) —
    Apache-2.0. tt-bio fetches them on first use, trying the moritztng/
    protenix-v0.5.0 Hugging Face mirror first and ByteDance's own release URL
    after it. Not shipped here; the venue is offline at show time, so they are
    fetched at install time. tt-bio does not download Protenix v2, because its
    weights may not be redistributed without the rights holder's consent.

tt-bio bundles further third-party code of its own (ESMFold2 host-side
reference, the OpenFold3 data pipeline, BoltzGen) — see that project's NOTICE
for the full list. This project does not redistribute any of it.

