## Scientific credit

The demo exists to show other people's science running on Tenstorrent
hardware. The structure prediction is not ours:

  * Boltz-2 / Boltz-1 — Wohlwend, Corso, Passaro et al. The code tt-bio is
    built on.
  * Protenix v1 (the v0.5.0 checkpoint) — ByteDance. The model this booth folds
    with by default.
  * OpenFold3 — the OpenFold Consortium.
  * tt-bio — Moritz Thüning (github.com/moritztng/tt-bio), which is what makes
    any of it run on Tenstorrent silicon.

Protein sequences and reference structures are drawn from the public
literature and the Protein Data Bank.
